  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/zen-browser/desktop/zipball/1.22.1b",
  "body": "# Zen Stable Release\n\n\n## New Features\n- You now have the option to sync normal tabs across devices along with your Spaces, Folders, and other data. This can be enabled in Settings > Sync > Sync your Spaces across devices.\n- You can now share Spaces, folders and split views to other Zen users and non-Zen users via a shareable link. This can be found in the context menu of a Space, folder or split view.\n\n## Fixes\n- Noticeably improved performance and battery usage while scrolling, and playing videos.\n- Other bug fixes and improvements.\n",
